.TH STADIUM 1
.SH NAME
stadium \- stadium ball-throw toy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/stadium
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Stadium
is a stadium ball-throw toy.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Button 1 throws a ball among wandering fans. Enter reseeds the crowd.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B LMB
Throw ball toward click
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/stadium.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR wm (1)
